{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"UPX.UPX","latestVersion":"5.3.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"A free, secure, portable, extendable, high-performance executable packer for several executable formats.","license":"GPL-2.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/upx/upx/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"A free, secure, portable, extendable, high-performance executable packer for several executable formats.","license":"GPL-2.0-or-later","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/upx/upx/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"UPX is an advanced executable file compressor. UPX will typically reduce the file size of programs and DLLs by around 50%-70%, thus reducing disk space, network load times, download times and other distribution and storage costs.\nPrograms and libraries compressed by UPX are completely self-contained and run exactly as before, with no runtime or memory penalty for most of the supported formats.\nUPX supports a number of different executable formats, including Windows programs and DLLs, macOS apps and Linux executables.","name":"UPX","packageUrl":"https://upx.github.io/","publisher":"UPX","publisherUrl":"https://upx.github.io/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/upx/upx/blob/HEAD/NEWS","tags":["application","compress","compressor","dll","exe","executables","packer","program","software"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"免费（自由）、安全、便携、可扩展、高性能的可执行文件打包器，适用于多种可执行格式。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"UPX 是一个先进的可执行文件压缩器。UPX 通常会将程序和 DLL 的文件大小减少约 50%-70%，从而减少磁盘空间、网络加载时间、下载时间以及其它分发和存储开支。\n被 UPX 压缩的程序和库是完全独立的，运行起来和以前相比几乎没有差异，并且对于大多数支持的格式没有运行时间或内存的损失。\nUPX 支持多种可执行格式，包括 Windows 程序和 DLL、macOS 应用和 Linux 可执行文件。","tags":["dll","exe","压缩","压缩器","可执行文件","应用","打包器","程序","软件"]}},"longDescription":"UPX is an advanced executable file compressor. UPX will typically reduce the file size of programs and DLLs by around 50%-70%, thus reducing disk space, network load times, download times and other distribution and storage costs.\nPrograms and libraries compressed by UPX are completely self-contained and run exactly as before, with no runtime or memory penalty for most of the supported formats.\nUPX supports a number of different executable formats, including Windows programs and DLLs, macOS apps and Linux executables.","name":"UPX","packageUrl":"https://upx.github.io/","publisher":"UPX","publisherUrl":"https://upx.github.io/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/upx/upx/blob/HEAD/NEWS","tags":["application","compress","compressor","dll","exe","executables","packer","program","software"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/5.3.0/app.json","detailSha256":"4a23062ea43b654f2c858611ca128ba214a195dec971e59bcefb607216df128c","releaseDate":"2026-10-28","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.3.0"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/5.2.1/app.json","detailSha256":"8add725b6408ee1aec4ff40024bc35a7c299f95fd5cc2fcd8be9c8b6bb87c3c7","releaseDate":"2026-08-27","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.2.1"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/5.2.0/app.json","detailSha256":"2ecb4070c9f04020c4f847c682778db846807fdf2c32a64479db5758dcf7a0ca","releaseDate":"2026-06-08","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.2.0"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/5.1.1/app.json","detailSha256":"30eb7b492fdf10de3fed83650906f9dfa8029a45da02db47b5698276b9969c3e","releaseDate":"2026-03-05","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.1.1"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/5.1.0/app.json","detailSha256":"241729cf9ccf724c2d54d05b99ded8de01f6e68ebb9c5485aba300e13250b9b6","releaseDate":"2026-01-07","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"5.1.0"},{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/5.0.2/app.json","detailSha256":"bfb68955542b47f84a35e26f0423227ea1ff2cda7cd4b92014c20c774f1f1968","releaseDate":"2025-07-20","releaseDateSourc